<title>USA: Donnkenny expects year results below expectations.</title>
<headline>Donnkenny expects year results below expectations.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donnkenny Inc said on Friday it expects results for 1996 to be significantly below analysts' expectations of $1.30 to $1.40 per share.</p>
<p>Based on shipments to date, the company said it expects to be profitable in the fourth quarter and &quot;solidly profitable&quot; for the full fiscal year.</p>
</text>
